      "sourceTextSha256": "16537e3480831ec6d636d607a65c0f226320ef90abbc5f074f58c996cc1e84d6",
      "text": "After breakfast, a half-day excursion (4 hours) to one of Rio’s most famous landmarks. A cable car takes you to Sugar Loaf, stopping first at Urca Hill before continuing to the summit, with spectacular panoramic views of Guanabara Bay, Copacabana Beach, the surrounding mountains, the islands along the coast, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and Christ the Redeemer in the distance. The excursion continues through the historic centre, with its colonial buildings, churches, monasteries and the impressive Metropolitan Cathedral.",
