      "sourceTextSha256": "6c6c6f7b9b4ceda8b8a8bcb17f588df3fc5160d2427270aeb9d5aff774bd29b4",
      "text": "Day 4 · After breakfast, private transfer by road from Rio de Janeiro to Búzios. Check in at your hotel and enjoy the rest of the day at leisure. Once a charming fishing village, Búzios is now one of Brazil’s most captivating coastal destinations, renowned for its beautiful beaches, crystal-clear water and picturesque landscapes, with charming streets, boutiques and excellent restaurants that give the town a relaxed yet sophisticated atmosphere.",
